{"pagination":{"page":1,"size":1000},"total":18,"items":[{"id":"ArnoldClassicNorthAmerica2019","name":"Arnold Classic North America 2019","city":"Columbus, Ohio","country":"USA","date":{"from":"2019-03-02","till":"2019-03-02","numberOfDays":1},"isCanceled":false,"events":["222","333","444","555","pyram"],"wcaDelegates":[{"name":"Zachary Garber","email":"zgarber@worldcubeassociation.org"}],"organisers":[{"name":"Zachary Garber","email":"zgarber@worldcubeassociation.org"}],"venue":{"name":"Ohio Expo Center - Ohio State Fair","address":"717 E 17th Ave, Columbus, OH 43211","details":"Bricker Building","coordinates":{"latitude":40.00312,"longitude":-82.991732}},"information":"This competition will take place as part of the Arnold Classic Kids and Teen Expo which is held during the Arnold Classic Sports Festival. There are over 80 competitive events across 155,000 square feet in both Expo Centers. More information about this event can be found [here](https://www.arnoldsportsfestival.com/the-arnold/fitnessexpo/) Please note that the venue will probably be quite noisy at times. All competitors who register for this competition will get free entry to the Arnold Kids and Teen Expo, wristbands/ticket will be available to pick up at Will Call. However, all spectators over the age of 14 WILL BE required to purchase a ticket/wristband for the Arnold Sports Festival Kids and Teen Expo. There are single day passes as well as weekend passes available. Information about ticket purchases can be found [here](https://www.arnoldsportsfestival.com/tickets/) Tickets can be purchased for just the Kids and Teen Expo as well as upgraded tickets for both the Kids and Teen Expo along with the Arnold Sports Expo. There will also be a $10 fee per car for parking and information about that can be found [here](https://www.arnoldsportsfestival.com/visitor-info/parking-and-transportation/) There is free shuttle between the Kids and Teen Expo and the Sports Expo. IF you have any questions at all about this competition in terms of registration costs, tickets, parking, or anything else, please contact us before registering! ","externalWebsite":"NULL"},{"id":"CalabrianOpen2019","name":"Calabrian Open 2019","city":"Lamezia Terme","country":"IT","date":{"from":"2019-03-02","till":"2019-03-03","numberOfDays":2},"isCanceled":false,"events":["222","333","333bf","333fm","333oh","444","444bf","555","666","777","pyram","skewb"],"wcaDelegates":[{"name":"Gianluca Placenti","email":"gplacenti@worldcubeassociation.org"},{"name":"Lorenzo Vigani Poli","email":"lpoli@worldcubeassociation.org"},{"name":"Simone Cantarelli","email":"scantarelli@worldcubeassociation.org"}],"organisers":[{"name":"Francesco Iezzi","email":"cicciocz99@gmail.com"}],"venue":{"name":"[Gran Hotel Lamezia](http://grandhotellamezia.it/)","address":"Piazza Stazione Centrale, 88046 Lamezia Terme (CZ)","details":"Sala nº 7","coordinates":{"latitude":38.920938,"longitude":16.255517}},"information":"![Image description](http://i.imgur.com/yztC4Jt.png) [Clicca qui per il sito in italiano](https://www.cubingitaly.org/articoli/calabrian-open-2019)","externalWebsite":"NULL"},{"id":"CarteBlancheKubeOpen2019","name":"Carte Blanche Kube Open 2019","city":"Kanchipuram, Tamil Nadu","country":"IN","date":{"from":"2019-03-02","till":"2019-03-03","numberOfDays":2},"isCanceled":false,"events":["222","333","333bf","333fm","333ft","333mbf","333oh","444","444bf","555","555bf","666","777","clock","minx","pyram","skewb","sq1"],"wcaDelegates":[{"name":"Hari Anirudh","email":"harisv.1994@gmail.com"},{"name":"Sachin Arvind","email":"sarvind@worldcubeassociation.org"}],"organisers":[{"name":"Adithyaa Anand","email":"adithyaa.ma@gmail.com"},{"name":"SpeedCubers India","email":"chennaicubingclub@gmail.com"}],"venue":{"name":"Madras Institute of Technology","address":"MIT Road, Chromepet, Radha Nagar, Chennai, Tamil Nadu 600044","details":"Conference Room, Rajam Lecture Hall Complex (RLHC)","coordinates":{"latitude":12.94861,"longitude":8